config FW_CS_DSP
	tristate "Cirrus Logic DSP firmware support"
	default n
	help
	  Firmware loading and control for the Cirrus Logic DSP cores found
	  in their audio codecs.  In-tree codec drivers select this; say M
	  here only to build it for a codec driver that lives outside the
	  tree, which is how the CS35L43 amplifiers on some boards are
	  driven.

	  If unsure, say N.
